{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Casino Tycoon: Sin &amp; Win&quot; Demo</strong> is an open-world game where you can engage in gunfights, drive freely, scale low walls, and try your luck with simple gambling games. By earning your first fortune on this island town, you\u2019re on your way to becoming a future casino tycoon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069680/extras/43f3c27a385aaa16c18ac02b0d9e348e.avif?t=1760577697\" width=1536 height=864 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Lottery &amp; Slot Machines</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the demo, try your hand at the <strong>lottery</strong> and <strong>slot machines</strong> to earn your starting capital.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069680/extras/51f1bebf473c457515dfcfb7863f7c3d.avif?t=1760577697\" data-has-big width=1560 height=904 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gear Up</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch between <strong>rifles</strong> and <strong>pistols</strong> to handle any trouble that comes your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069680/extras/1d7fb8deec7b032ec28b7c35b67f2e6f.avif?t=1760577697\" data-has-big width=1560 height=841 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Freedom on the Road</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive across the island town\u2019s streets and lanes. Turn on the radio during your journey <strong>to play your favorite music</strong> and set the mood as you explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069680/extras/07026466c1c904b3faceab4e3bf1b301.avif?t=1760577697\" data-has-big width=1560 height=975 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Boundless Exploration</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freely explore this coastal island town\u2014climb over low walls or dive into the ocean for a swim.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069680/extras/dee917dd80de011a7f7db2349d2f5050.avif?t=1760577697\" data-has-big width=1560 height=975 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Living World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo features a <strong>simulated traffic system</strong> and <strong>pedestrian AI</strong>, creating a dynamic and immersive environment ready for you to explore at will.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069680/extras/4be0bf61e64a7b18029586311d22d21b.avif?t=1760577697\" width=1536 height=864 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please note:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo supports <strong>single-player only</strong>. On this tranquil island, sharpen your patience and gambling skills through <strong>lottery &amp; slot machines</strong>\u2014and build the foundation for your future rise in the big city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4069680?t=1760577697","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4069680?t=1760577697","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069680/5bd1e198794b28dda7c0efafc52307a8d47f9ba8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760577697","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069680/5bd1e198794b28dda7c0efafc52307a8d47f9ba8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760577697","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The game contains slight nudity, violence, and guns, but does not include sexual assault, drug use, self-harm, etc. It may not be suitable for all ages.\r\n\r\nAll main characters are over 18 years old"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Casino Tycoon: Sin &amp; Win&quot; Demo</strong> is an open-world game where you can engage in gunfights, drive freely, scale low walls, and try your luck with simple gambling games. By earning your first fortune on this island town, you\u2019re on your way to becoming a future casino tycoon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069680/extras/43f3c27a385aaa16c18ac02b0d9e348e.avif?t=1760577697\" width=1536 height=864 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Lottery &amp; Slot Machines</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the demo, try your hand at the <strong>lottery</strong> and <strong>slot machines</strong> to earn your starting capital.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069680/extras/51f1bebf473c457515dfcfb7863f7c3d.avif?t=1760577697\" data-has-big width=1560 height=904 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gear Up</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch between <strong>rifles</strong> and <strong>pistols</strong> to handle any trouble that comes your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069680/extras/1d7fb8deec7b032ec28b7c35b67f2e6f.avif?t=1760577697\" data-has-big width=1560 height=841 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Freedom on the Road</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive across the island town\u2019s streets and lanes. Turn on the radio during your journey <strong>to play your favorite music</strong> and set the mood as you explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069680/extras/07026466c1c904b3faceab4e3bf1b301.avif?t=1760577697\" data-has-big width=1560 height=975 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Boundless Exploration</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freely explore this coastal island town\u2014climb over low walls or dive into the ocean for a swim.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069680/extras/dee917dd80de011a7f7db2349d2f5050.avif?t=1760577697\" data-has-big width=1560 height=975 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Living World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo features a <strong>simulated traffic system</strong> and <strong>pedestrian AI</strong>, creating a dynamic and immersive environment ready for you to explore at will.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069680/extras/4be0bf61e64a7b18029586311d22d21b.avif?t=1760577697\" width=1536 height=864 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please note:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo supports <strong>single-player only</strong>. On this tranquil island, sharpen your patience and gambling skills through <strong>lottery &amp; slot machines</strong>\u2014and build the foundation for your future rise in the big city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Eternal Studio"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3942290","name":"Casino Tycoon: Sin & Win"},"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Ca