ot; Demo is an open-world experience where you can gear up, drive around, climb, and swim. In this demo version, only one island town map is available. Try your luck with lottery and slot machines to earn your first fortune \u2014 this coastal town is where your fortune begins.","steam_appid":4069680,"support_info":{"email":"duanxiaoyao@126.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English, Simplified Chinese","type":"demo","website":null}